# ---- Too large for GitHub
# Per-run training output (~16 GB): fine-tuned checkpoints (best.pt, ~330 MB each) and per-study
# prediction parquet files. Every metric is aggregated in results/runs.parquet (tracked).
runs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
# Bootstrap resampling caches (~70 MB); rebuild with code/bootcache.py
results/cache/

# ---- Radiology report text from the RSNA 2026 Knee dataset
# Kaggle competition data may not be redistributed, and the project rule is that no
# reports or images leave the machine (PROJECT_PLAN 13). These files quote report text verbatim.
label_audit/*_sample_reports.txt
labeling/runs/
